WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.850 --> 01:31.140
[My Journey to You]

01:31.170 --> 01:34.070
[Episode 5]

02:01.980 --> 02:03.040
Tomorrow morning,

02:03.140 --> 02:04.500
Gong Shangjue's messenger pigeon

02:04.500 --> 02:07.960
will fly back into the Gong's residence with the information.

02:08.139 --> 02:08.680
Yes.

02:09.660 --> 02:10.400
I know.

02:13.140 --> 02:14.120
Are you ready?

02:15.570 --> 02:17.170
Just waiting for the result.

02:17.590 --> 02:19.190
There's nothing to prepare.

02:20.340 --> 02:22.180
What if the result is different

02:22.540 --> 02:23.870
from what you expected?

02:24.490 --> 02:25.550
What if we made

02:25.960 --> 02:26.760
the wrong bet?

02:30.380 --> 02:31.440
It can't be helped.

02:35.320 --> 02:35.910
It can.

02:47.090 --> 02:48.490
Take someone as hostage,

02:48.960 --> 02:50.220
and escape unscathed.

02:53.500 --> 02:56.030
Everyone in the Gong family is unfathomable.

02:57.579 --> 02:58.860
Even the Eldest Young Miss

02:58.860 --> 02:59.500
whom we

02:59.500 --> 03:01.700
normally take lightly of,

03:05.060 --> 03:07.010
we may not even be her match.

03:08.540 --> 03:10.210
Then take hostage of someone

03:10.660 --> 03:12.920
that you think will most likely succeed.

03:14.100 --> 03:14.760
Who is that?

03:17.530 --> 03:18.110
Me.

03:21.450 --> 03:22.180
You?

03:25.820 --> 03:27.140
Why do you think

03:28.570 --> 03:30.060
Gong Family would spare

03:30.920 --> 03:32.750
an assassin from Wufeng for you?

03:34.660 --> 03:36.660
Do you think Gong Shangjue chose you

03:37.980 --> 03:39.579
because he really loves you?

03:41.579 --> 03:42.640
He doesn't love me.

03:43.720 --> 03:45.290
He only loves himself.

03:51.579 --> 03:53.250
Do you know why he chose me?

04:05.500 --> 04:07.500
Because the jade pendant on my waist

04:07.540 --> 04:09.250
belongs to him.

04:10.310 --> 04:11.890
He must be curious

04:12.140 --> 04:13.770
why I have this jade pendant.

04:14.370 --> 04:16.240
So before he figures this out,

04:17.399 --> 04:19.440
he won't let me die so easily.

04:23.140 --> 04:24.200
You're gambling.

04:26.920 --> 04:27.960
You are, too.

04:28.880 --> 04:30.010
We're all gambling.

04:31.380 --> 04:32.470
What if we lose?

04:38.659 --> 04:39.980
Regardless of whether Gong Shangjue

04:39.980 --> 04:41.440
cares about my life or not,

04:42.590 --> 04:43.580
I believe

04:44.760 --> 04:46.500
you won't really hurt me.

04:48.550 --> 04:49.420
Killing me

04:49.590 --> 04:50.790
will do no good to you.

04:52.240 --> 04:53.409
With your ability,

04:54.330 --> 04:55.330
you can't kill me.

04:55.980 --> 04:57.580
At most, you can only hurt me.

04:58.580 --> 04:59.640
If you hurt me,

05:00.240 --> 05:01.270
it's even better.

05:02.330 --> 05:04.380
Run away if you hurt me.

05:05.210 --> 05:07.590
If you can survive after you run away,

05:07.780 --> 05:09.040
count yourself lucky.

05:11.120 --> 05:12.400
If you die,

05:13.500 --> 05:14.670
it's even better.

05:16.070 --> 05:18.270
It can further prove that I have nothing

05:18.820 --> 05:19.920
to do with Wufeng.

05:26.780 --> 05:29.640
You have already planned everything, haven't you.

05:32.460 --> 05:34.150
Two wolves disguised as dogs,

05:34.340 --> 05:35.820
sneaking into a herd of sheep.

05:35.820 --> 05:37.850
If one of the wolves is exposed,

05:38.220 --> 05:39.520
the other wolf

05:39.640 --> 05:41.300
should bite him immediately.

05:42.210 --> 05:43.420
The remaining wolf

05:43.890 --> 05:45.480
will become a dog forever

05:45.920 --> 05:47.980
and become one with the herd of sheep,

05:48.460 --> 05:50.220
eating one sheep a day.

05:51.020 --> 05:52.220
No one will suspect

05:52.220 --> 05:53.450
that fake dog.

05:55.210 --> 05:56.870
Because it once killed a wolf.

05:59.400 --> 06:00.730
You're really amazing.

06:05.330 --> 06:07.120
If your identity is exposed,

06:08.640 --> 06:09.960
before you die,

06:11.650 --> 06:12.860
wouldn't it be good

06:13.450 --> 06:14.250
to protect me?

06:17.030 --> 06:17.880
Besides,

06:18.340 --> 06:20.140
this is just the worst scenario.

06:20.800 --> 06:23.890
If Wufeng had already made necessary arrangements for your identity,

06:23.890 --> 06:24.950
then none of this

06:25.990 --> 06:27.050
would ever happen.

06:28.980 --> 06:30.380
You're so cold-blooded.

06:32.200 --> 06:34.130
I thought you would have emotions.

06:39.130 --> 06:40.930
Why are we at the Gong Residence?

06:42.140 --> 06:43.170
To make friends?

06:46.770 --> 06:47.750
Calling

06:48.650 --> 06:50.610
each other sisters everyday...

06:52.480 --> 06:54.540
Really made you think we are sisters?

06:55.330 --> 06:56.600
Come to your senses.

07:05.140 --> 07:06.270
Are Mei people

07:08.610 --> 07:09.980
so cruel?

07:15.130 --> 07:16.930
That's because you haven't seen

07:17.210 --> 07:18.110
Wang and Liang.

07:24.980 --> 07:26.890
Miss Yun Weishan and Miss Shangguan Qian,

07:26.890 --> 07:29.020
please head to the Sword Wielder Hall.

07:31.980 --> 07:32.950
It's late.

07:33.780 --> 07:35.360
Why are you summoning us

07:35.740 --> 07:36.750
in such a hurry?

07:37.090 --> 07:39.280
I heard that the identity of you two

07:39.370 --> 07:41.970
have been sent back to the valley ahead of time.

08:03.200 --> 08:04.140
After verification,

08:04.140 --> 08:07.010
Miss Shangguan Qian from Dafu City's identity is verified.

08:07.010 --> 08:08.470
There is nothing unusual.

08:09.220 --> 08:10.130
After verification,

08:10.130 --> 08:12.530
Miss Yun Weishan from Lixi Town's identity

08:12.980 --> 08:14.030
is inaccurate.

08:21.130 --> 08:22.460
Young Master Shangjue,

08:23.890 --> 08:26.020
what's inaccurate about my identity?

08:27.970 --> 08:29.170
I have a few questions

08:30.000 --> 08:31.400
I'd like to ask you first.

08:32.610 --> 08:33.140
Go ahead.

08:34.789 --> 08:36.120
On the day you left home,

08:36.539 --> 08:39.000
did you meet with thieves in your residence?

08:49.050 --> 08:51.250
There was indeed a thief who came to rob.

08:52.130 --> 08:54.270
We lost some gold and silver jewellery.

08:54.270 --> 08:56.410
Fortunately, no one was injured or killed.

08:56.410 --> 08:57.810
Why didn't you report it?

08:59.730 --> 09:02.820
We encountered bad people and evil things on my wedding day.

09:02.820 --> 09:04.550
It felt a little inauspicious.

09:04.810 --> 09:06.770
I was afraid that the Gong Family would not like it.

09:06.770 --> 09:08.570
Also, my family was not injured.

09:08.750 --> 09:10.450
I thought it was a small matter,

09:10.450 --> 09:11.390
so I hid it.

09:17.100 --> 09:18.960
Please punish me, Sword Wielder.

09:19.340 --> 09:20.400
It's human nature.

09:20.960 --> 09:21.790
I understand.

09:24.740 --> 09:25.940
That's all you found?

09:26.810 --> 09:28.540
Just with this trivial matter,

09:28.550 --> 09:31.010
you are saying her identity is not accurate?

09:31.290 --> 09:33.000
The guards from Gong Residence

09:33.000 --> 09:34.700
went to Yun Weishan's hometown,

09:34.700 --> 09:35.430
Lixi Town.

09:39.580 --> 09:40.850
Do you know this Miss Yun Weishan?

09:40.850 --> 09:42.850
With the portrait the painter drew,

09:42.860 --> 09:44.920
they went to ask Yun Family about her.

09:45.790 --> 09:46.400
However,

09:47.820 --> 09:49.760
no one recognized your portrait.

09:53.490 --> 09:54.430
Ziyu.

09:55.740 --> 09:56.270
This...

09:57.090 --> 09:58.820
is not a trivial matter, right?

10:04.580 --> 10:05.230
Miss Yun,

10:08.930 --> 10:10.260
did you really lie to us?

10:15.040 --> 10:15.570
Do it!

10:24.570 --> 10:25.770
Remember what I said.

10:26.450 --> 10:27.310
No matter what,

10:27.810 --> 10:29.940
you have to hold firm to your identity.

10:43.530 --> 10:45.660
I grew up in the Yun family in Lixi Town.

10:47.030 --> 10:49.160
I've seen the portrait by the painter.

10:49.930 --> 10:52.190
The painting and strokes are exquisite.

10:53.440 --> 10:54.360
My neighbors

10:55.020 --> 10:56.820
and the servants in my residence

10:57.530 --> 10:58.650
wouldn't have not been able

10:58.650 --> 11:00.580
to recognize me from the portrait.

11:01.460 --> 11:03.660
I don't understand why they'd say that.

11:05.330 --> 11:06.080
Unless...

11:08.330 --> 11:09.810
Unless it is a different portrait

11:09.810 --> 11:11.740
that you have brought to show them.

11:13.960 --> 11:16.890
If Young Master Shangjue thinks my identity is fake,

11:18.100 --> 11:19.210
you can kill

11:20.210 --> 11:20.940
or arrest me.

11:21.220 --> 11:22.420
I have nothing to say.

11:24.820 --> 11:27.110
But I am the eldest daughter of Lixi Town's

11:27.110 --> 11:28.680
Yun family, Yun Weishan.

11:44.210 --> 11:45.470
Why are you so nervous?

11:55.210 --> 11:56.540
Miss Yun's identity...

12:01.610 --> 12:03.210
Isn't this Miss Yun Weishan?

12:03.490 --> 12:04.740
Nanny, are you getting old?

12:04.740 --> 12:06.600
Is your eyesight deteriorating?

12:06.820 --> 12:08.020
It's painted so well.

12:11.220 --> 12:11.710
Gosh.

12:14.050 --> 12:15.250
It really is Weishan.

12:15.380 --> 12:15.810
Gosh.

12:16.150 --> 12:16.880
My goodness.

12:18.270 --> 12:19.600
Miss Yun's identity...

12:21.550 --> 12:22.580
was verified.

12:24.870 --> 12:26.520
It was just a pressure test.

12:28.120 --> 12:29.180
Please forgive me.

12:30.010 --> 12:30.610
After all,

12:31.600 --> 12:33.440
you're the bride chosen by Ziyu.

12:34.560 --> 12:36.560
Of course I should be more cautious.

12:41.330 --> 12:42.460
By the way, Miss Yun.

12:43.690 --> 12:44.820
After you left home,

12:45.090 --> 12:46.950
your mother missed you very much.

12:47.580 --> 12:49.440
My men have already conveyed that

12:49.810 --> 12:51.870
you're doing well in the Gong Family.

12:52.420 --> 12:54.480
Madam Yun wants to pass you a message.

12:55.150 --> 12:55.810
She said...

12:57.120 --> 12:59.120
being able to enter the Gong Family,

12:59.160 --> 13:00.360
and be chosen by Ziyu,

13:01.590 --> 13:02.320
is your luck.

13:04.120 --> 13:04.800
Miss Yun,

13:05.450 --> 13:07.180
you must serve Young Lord Hanyu

13:07.700 --> 13:09.000
well.

13:14.900 --> 13:16.700
This matter has been concluded.

13:16.980 --> 13:18.110
There is no problem

13:19.070 --> 13:20.550
with Yun Weishan's identity.

13:20.550 --> 13:21.900
Both ladies' identities

13:21.900 --> 13:22.690
are fine.

13:23.210 --> 13:24.070
This matter

13:24.690 --> 13:25.490
will end here.

13:28.090 --> 13:29.140
They are fine,

13:30.160 --> 13:31.620
but I'm not sure about you.

13:34.970 --> 13:35.530
Jin Fan.

13:36.770 --> 13:38.100
Go get Housekeeper Jia.

13:38.410 --> 13:38.790
Yes.

13:44.690 --> 13:45.690
Housekeeper Jia,

13:46.550 --> 13:48.170
tell them everything

13:48.500 --> 13:49.760
you've told me before.

13:49.930 --> 13:50.450
Yes.

14:01.660 --> 14:02.610
The person who ordered me

14:02.610 --> 14:05.690
to replace the Ethereal Flowers needed for the Herb Elixir

14:05.690 --> 14:06.830
with Spirit Herb...

14:07.420 --> 14:07.890
was...

14:10.010 --> 14:11.270
Young Master Yuanzhi.

14:12.230 --> 14:13.290
Bastard!

14:13.410 --> 14:15.470
What nonsense are you talking about?

14:15.910 --> 14:16.490
Hold it!

14:17.030 --> 14:18.160
How inappropriate!

14:19.580 --> 14:20.860
Who ordered you to frame me?

14:20.860 --> 14:21.340
Speak!

14:21.450 --> 14:22.000
Yuanzhi.

14:24.050 --> 14:24.860
Housekeeper Jia.

14:24.860 --> 14:25.660
Make it clear!

14:26.350 --> 14:28.140
When Young Master gave the order,

14:28.140 --> 14:30.620
I thought he had developed

14:30.810 --> 14:32.070
a better prescription

14:32.330 --> 14:33.610
and that there was a replacement.

14:33.610 --> 14:34.470
I didn't know

14:34.810 --> 14:37.040
the former Sword Wielder and Young Master would die because of this.

14:37.040 --> 14:39.160
Otherwise, I wouldn't have dared to

14:39.340 --> 14:40.930
no matter how bold I am.

14:41.690 --> 14:42.850
Please be fair.

14:46.410 --> 14:46.940
Brother.

14:47.770 --> 14:48.600
I didn't do it.

14:50.570 --> 14:52.330
It's all Gong Ziyue who bribed this bastard servant

14:52.330 --> 14:52.990
to frame me.

14:54.270 --> 14:56.800
Both Yuanzhi and Housekeeper Jia have differing statements.

14:56.800 --> 14:58.130
We shouldn't be biased.

14:59.060 --> 15:00.630
This is an important matter.

15:00.630 --> 15:01.310
How about

15:01.620 --> 15:04.680
we imprison Housekeeper Jia to interrogate him first?

15:04.810 --> 15:06.140
See if there was someone

15:06.660 --> 15:08.460
who was trying to set someone up.

15:09.210 --> 15:10.410
We have witness and evidence.

15:10.410 --> 15:12.070
What's there to interrogate?

15:12.160 --> 15:12.860
Besides,

15:13.450 --> 15:15.250
you said we shouldn't be biased.

15:15.340 --> 15:17.870
We should interrogate both of them together.

15:18.050 --> 15:18.520
Sure.

15:18.690 --> 15:20.030
I'll leave Yuanzhi to you.

15:20.030 --> 15:20.970
Feel free to interrogate him any way you want.

15:20.970 --> 15:23.290
There are tons of poisons in Zhi Lineage that will make life worse than death.

15:23.290 --> 15:24.690
It's not impossible that you'd end up

15:24.690 --> 15:25.570
forcing a false testimony out of him.

15:25.570 --> 15:27.300
Whatever method or poison we use,

15:27.300 --> 15:28.990
you can do the same too.

15:29.690 --> 15:30.820
If you don't have it,

15:31.260 --> 15:33.920
I can get someone to send it from the Zhi Lineage.

15:36.080 --> 15:37.540
-Stop!
-Housekeeper Jia.

16:14.490 --> 16:15.090
Oh no.

16:19.980 --> 16:20.840
Sword Wielder!

16:22.850 --> 16:23.320
Fool.

17:06.960 --> 17:08.420
[Gong]

17:18.530 --> 17:19.329
Gong Yuanzhi!

17:19.530 --> 17:20.930
I'm afraid he'd run away.

17:21.280 --> 17:22.520
You're trying to kill him among the chaos

17:22.520 --> 17:24.490
so the evidence will be destroyed along with him!

17:24.490 --> 17:25.119
Gong Ziyu,

17:25.770 --> 17:27.200
you're someone of the Gong Family after all.

17:27.200 --> 17:28.240
Aren't you afraid

17:28.310 --> 17:30.290
you'd be laughed at for saying something like this?

17:30.290 --> 17:31.340
My secret weapon

17:31.450 --> 17:33.250
is laced with paralysis poison.

17:33.410 --> 17:36.260
It just made his meridians stiff and him unable to move.

17:36.260 --> 17:38.640
He died from the poison pouch between his teeth that he bit.

17:38.640 --> 17:39.700
That's but a one-sided statement!

17:39.700 --> 17:41.220
Send the body to the clinic,

17:41.220 --> 17:43.690
-and you will know after an examination.
-Of course I will.

17:43.690 --> 17:45.200
But before the truth comes out,

17:45.200 --> 17:46.800
you can't be rid of suspicions.

17:46.800 --> 17:48.290
He ran away in fear of his crimes just now.

17:48.290 --> 17:50.550
Isn't that enough to prove my innocence?

17:51.090 --> 17:53.690
Since Gong Yuanzhi is the most suspicious now,

17:54.560 --> 17:56.220
we should arrest him first.

17:58.250 --> 17:58.780
Brother.

18:00.770 --> 18:02.300
We'll have to bother the elders

18:02.300 --> 18:04.870
to dispatch Yellow Jade Guardians for the investigation.

18:04.870 --> 18:07.800
If it's proven that it's really done by Gong Yuanzhi,

18:08.010 --> 18:09.540
we can't let him off easily.

18:13.840 --> 18:15.040
But if we find out that

18:16.200 --> 18:18.250
someone is setting up Yuanzhi,

18:19.370 --> 18:21.230
or torture him to get a statement,

18:21.250 --> 18:23.050
or even use poison to murder him,

18:24.140 --> 18:26.000
I will make them pay with his life.

18:27.660 --> 18:28.720
No matter who it is.

18:36.170 --> 18:36.700
Brother.

18:38.200 --> 18:39.260
I'll listen to you.

18:41.240 --> 18:41.790
Jin Fan.

18:42.950 --> 18:43.750
Take him away.

18:44.770 --> 18:45.170
Yes.

18:50.430 --> 18:50.880
Let go!

18:52.220 --> 18:53.750
I know the way to the prison.

18:54.050 --> 18:55.180
I can walk by myself.

18:57.410 --> 18:58.010
By the way,

18:59.410 --> 19:00.740
if you need any medicine,

19:00.740 --> 19:03.200
I can get someone to have it delivered to you.

19:56.870 --> 19:58.270
What are you angry about?

19:58.790 --> 20:00.720
Gong Shangjue is too overbearing.

20:02.620 --> 20:05.150
No matter what, you're still the Sword Wielder.

20:05.150 --> 20:06.150
He completely...

20:09.050 --> 20:10.610
Disrespects me.

20:12.940 --> 20:13.660
I know.

20:15.210 --> 20:15.990
Not only him,

20:17.740 --> 20:19.140
in the eyes of the elders,

20:20.450 --> 20:23.050
I don't deserve to be the Sword Wielder either.

20:25.730 --> 20:26.790
In terms of status,

20:27.640 --> 20:28.300
ability,

20:28.760 --> 20:29.560
and morality,

20:31.700 --> 20:33.900
I don't deserve to be the Sword Wielder.

20:35.690 --> 20:39.950
If it weren't for the family rule for the inheritance that can't be breached,

20:41.450 --> 20:42.590
I believe the elders

20:42.730 --> 20:44.130
would have also chosen Gong Shangjue.

20:44.130 --> 20:45.130
Sword Wielder...

20:50.410 --> 20:52.870
When the poisonous smoke exploded just now,

20:52.970 --> 20:53.890
it was Shang Gongjue who

20:53.890 --> 20:56.220
stood in front of the elders immediately.

20:59.130 --> 21:00.210
In his eyes,

21:01.290 --> 21:02.490
family bloodline

21:03.770 --> 21:05.070
always comes first.

21:06.220 --> 21:07.420
And my internal force

21:09.330 --> 21:12.660
is not enough to even dispel the poisonous smoke in the hall.

21:16.640 --> 21:18.700
If Gong Shangjue weren't here today,

21:19.720 --> 21:22.050
the consequences would be unimaginable.

21:29.530 --> 21:30.880
It's laughable.

21:31.960 --> 21:33.690
I'm the Sword Wielder,

21:37.130 --> 21:40.130
yet I don't even have the ability to protect everyone.

21:40.360 --> 21:41.050
Father.

21:41.770 --> 21:42.680
I'm cold.

21:43.680 --> 21:44.940
Why isn't Huanyu cold?

21:50.170 --> 21:51.770
You slack off every time you practice.

21:51.770 --> 21:54.630
You don't deserve to be the son of the Sword Wielder.

21:57.160 --> 21:59.290
The elders have taken the Herb Elixir.

22:00.210 --> 22:01.490
They will be fine.

22:01.690 --> 22:03.220
But my father and the others

22:05.160 --> 22:06.730
also took the Herb Elixir.

22:11.970 --> 22:12.430
Take it.

22:19.880 --> 22:20.480
Brother.

22:20.480 --> 22:21.360
Yes?

22:21.960 --> 22:24.020
I really don't like wielding swords.

22:24.720 --> 22:27.450
Fighting and killing all day messes with my mind.

22:30.450 --> 22:33.050
You should at least learn to protect yourself.

22:36.640 --> 22:37.680
Is Wufeng...

22:38.360 --> 22:39.770
really that scary?

22:45.440 --> 22:46.410
Yes.

22:52.130 --> 22:52.930
Brother.

22:54.170 --> 22:55.630
You'll protect me, right?

22:55.890 --> 22:56.600
Of course.

22:57.920 --> 22:58.920
What about you?

22:59.480 --> 23:01.810
Don't you have anyone you want to protect?

23:04.890 --> 23:05.680
No.

23:06.520 --> 23:08.650
Don't you want to protect your family?

23:14.440 --> 23:16.100
My family is stronger than me.

23:16.290 --> 23:18.020
They don't need my protection.

23:21.160 --> 23:22.530
You have to protect

23:23.250 --> 23:24.650
the girl you like, right?

23:24.690 --> 23:26.020
I don't have one either.

23:30.530 --> 23:31.610
There will be one.

23:39.680 --> 23:41.740
You don't have to find excuses for me.

23:43.240 --> 23:44.050
Maybe...

23:47.240 --> 23:48.570
I just don't deserve it.

24:01.620 --> 24:02.070
Sir,

24:02.450 --> 24:04.910
there is a secret compartment in the drawer.

24:05.630 --> 24:06.450
You leave too.

24:07.800 --> 24:26.260
[Clinic
Housekeeper Jia's room]

24:43.160 --> 24:43.630
Mei...

24:58.210 --> 24:59.490
All these years,

25:00.520 --> 25:02.120
has no one succeeded before?

25:03.190 --> 25:03.650
No.

25:05.330 --> 25:06.460
In the past 20 years,

25:07.220 --> 25:09.310
everyone who sneaked into Gong Residence

25:09.310 --> 25:10.330
has gone missing.

25:11.940 --> 25:12.940
Not a single news.

25:13.610 --> 25:15.010
No body was found either.

25:16.040 --> 25:18.100
As if they disappeared into thin air.

25:20.160 --> 25:20.780
Except...

25:29.620 --> 25:30.680
Except for Yun Que.

25:34.920 --> 25:37.250
Are you still upset about Yun Que's death?

25:37.300 --> 25:38.580
She's my only sister.

25:43.890 --> 25:44.930
All the more

25:45.730 --> 25:48.530
you have to take revenge on the Gong Family for her.

25:50.170 --> 25:54.170
Since you know that there is no chance of winning sending people into the Gong Family,

25:54.170 --> 25:56.290
why do you keep sending people to die?

26:09.160 --> 26:11.490
We thought we had no chance of winning too.

26:12.400 --> 26:13.730
But someone succeeded.

26:15.090 --> 26:17.090
Their success changed everything.

26:18.110 --> 26:19.150
22 years ago,

26:19.570 --> 26:21.690
they successfully sneaked into the Gong Family,

26:21.690 --> 26:23.750
but no one heard from them ever again.

26:24.210 --> 26:27.010
When Wufeng assumed that their identity was exposed and had died

26:27.010 --> 26:28.740
they delivered a message back.

26:30.110 --> 26:31.680
This is the first assassin

26:32.050 --> 26:33.850
since Wufeng's establishment,

26:34.090 --> 26:36.740
that was able to deliver a secret letter from within Gong Residence.

26:36.740 --> 26:37.950
That secret letter

26:38.340 --> 26:39.540
changed everything.

26:41.460 --> 26:42.860
The marriage selection?

26:43.130 --> 26:43.450
Yes.

26:44.650 --> 26:47.290
The Gong Family's marriage selection is quite an event,

26:47.290 --> 26:48.750
but it keeps a low profile.

26:50.150 --> 26:52.030
The gossip among the martial world

26:52.030 --> 26:53.630
are just groundless rumors.

26:53.930 --> 26:55.460
But the letter of Anonymous

26:55.870 --> 26:57.330
proved all speculations.

26:58.020 --> 26:58.770
And

26:59.230 --> 27:01.890
they mentioned the most important thing of all,

27:02.400 --> 27:05.260
that the next marriage selection of the Gong Family

27:05.270 --> 27:06.580
will be in 20 years.

27:09.310 --> 27:10.710
It's been almost 20 years

27:12.300 --> 27:13.770
since I entered Wufeng.

27:14.920 --> 27:16.330
It was also from then on

27:16.770 --> 27:18.630
that all the new members of Wufeng

27:19.050 --> 27:20.370
became women.

27:25.830 --> 27:26.630
Is this person

27:27.860 --> 27:28.750
still alive?

27:29.500 --> 27:30.230
I don't know.

27:31.750 --> 27:32.350
Since then

27:32.370 --> 27:34.040
we've never heard from them.

27:35.020 --> 27:37.110
The Gong Family pushed the marriage selection

27:37.110 --> 27:38.470
to be before 20 years.

27:39.510 --> 27:40.240
It seems

27:40.790 --> 27:42.450
this person has been exposed.

27:44.390 --> 27:45.470
Who are they?

27:46.520 --> 27:48.180
Because they're too special,

27:48.220 --> 27:49.300
their identity

27:49.300 --> 27:49.990
age,

27:49.990 --> 27:50.740
gender,

27:50.740 --> 27:51.340
and name,

27:52.090 --> 27:53.290
are strictly sealed.

27:53.540 --> 27:55.200
The confidentiality is high.

27:55.470 --> 27:56.930
I'm afraid not many people

27:57.540 --> 27:59.340
knows about them within Wufeng.

28:00.090 --> 28:01.930
So everyone calls them

28:03.610 --> 28:04.370
Anonymous.

28:07.430 --> 28:08.360
I didn't expect Anonymous

28:08.360 --> 28:11.020
is able to live in the Gong Residence for so long.

28:12.020 --> 28:15.100
No matter how long they've lived, they're about to die now.

28:15.100 --> 28:16.960
Since the token has been exposed,

28:17.470 --> 28:18.790
the Gong Family will definitely

28:18.790 --> 28:20.650
continue to trace down this clue.

28:21.330 --> 28:22.860
The Gong Family can think of

28:24.130 --> 28:25.750
what we can think of.

28:26.980 --> 28:27.620
It seems

28:29.250 --> 28:30.720
this Wufeng spy

28:31.020 --> 28:32.750
has been hiding for many years.

28:33.640 --> 28:36.100
On the night before the marriage selection,

28:36.620 --> 28:37.710
he got a chance

28:37.950 --> 28:39.370
to switch the previous Sword Wielder and

28:39.370 --> 28:41.030
and Young Lord's Herb Elixir.

28:41.570 --> 28:43.630
With Zheng Nanyi, the Wufeng spy that managed to sneak in,

28:43.630 --> 28:44.690
they collaborated

28:44.900 --> 28:46.900
and completed this assassination.

28:46.950 --> 28:47.270
Yes.

28:47.680 --> 28:49.680
Since it's Wufeng who is doing this,

28:50.220 --> 28:53.280
we can't fall for their attempt to sow discord among us.

28:53.940 --> 28:56.800
The Gong Family always prioritizes our bloodline.

28:57.070 --> 29:01.010
It is inevitable that we will face instability as we transition between the former and current Sword Wielder.

29:01.010 --> 29:02.080
We shouldn't

29:02.110 --> 29:05.100
doubt each other in our bloodline,

29:05.500 --> 29:06.700
and lose our harmony.

29:07.020 --> 29:09.480
Wouldn't that be exactly what Wufeng wants?

29:10.100 --> 29:11.110
From now on,

29:11.680 --> 29:14.940
the Gong Family should never show anything as disgraceful as internal feuds.

29:14.940 --> 29:16.500
This will be the end of it.

29:17.660 --> 29:19.310
The world has been notified of the change of

29:19.310 --> 29:20.970
Gong Family's Sword Wielder.

29:21.200 --> 29:22.930
It will be taking it too lightly

29:22.940 --> 29:24.600
if were to change it again now.

29:25.450 --> 29:26.230
But

29:27.340 --> 29:29.110
for a useless man

29:29.780 --> 29:31.880
to be taking the position of the Sword Wielder,

29:31.880 --> 29:33.340
will only make Gong Family

29:33.590 --> 29:34.940
a laughing stock in the martial world.

29:34.940 --> 29:37.000
Who are you calling a laughing stock?

29:39.300 --> 29:40.620
All the former Sword Wielders

29:40.620 --> 29:42.120
were selected from the most outstanding

29:42.120 --> 29:43.520
heirs of the Gong Family.

29:43.980 --> 29:44.830
Even I,

29:45.020 --> 29:46.850
and the former Young Lord Gong Huanyu

29:46.850 --> 29:48.060
had to successfully pass

29:48.060 --> 29:49.700
the Trial of the Three Realms at the back hill

29:49.700 --> 29:50.450
to get the

29:50.630 --> 29:52.230
candidacy of the Young Lord.

29:53.380 --> 29:55.380
In terms of martial arts and wisdom,

29:55.490 --> 29:57.350
in terms of expectations of the martial world,

29:57.350 --> 29:58.090
Gong Ziyu

29:58.970 --> 30:00.700
doesn't deserve the position.

30:01.310 --> 30:03.240
He managed to take on this position

30:03.500 --> 30:04.830
taking the advantage of

30:05.310 --> 30:07.760
the ancestral rules due to sudden occurrences.

30:07.760 --> 30:08.570
Elders,

30:09.330 --> 30:10.990
if we want to follow the rules,

30:11.330 --> 30:12.250
the rule that the successor

30:12.250 --> 30:13.090
must pass

30:13.110 --> 30:15.910
the Trial of the Three Realms at the back mountain,

30:16.780 --> 30:18.510
should also be adhered, right?

30:20.620 --> 30:21.580
At that time,

30:21.810 --> 30:22.920
it was urgent.

30:23.700 --> 30:24.890
That was the only way.

30:24.890 --> 30:25.590
But now,

30:26.320 --> 30:27.580
we have plenty of time.

30:29.600 --> 30:32.060
If Ziyu can pass the Trial of the Three Realms

30:32.260 --> 30:33.310
in a month,

30:35.540 --> 30:38.140
I'll accept his position as the Sword Wielder.

30:39.200 --> 30:40.310
One month's time.

30:42.080 --> 30:43.310
You might as well just

30:43.340 --> 30:44.740
take away my position as the Sword Wielder.

30:44.740 --> 30:47.220
Why make things difficult for me intentionally?

30:47.220 --> 30:50.550
If you can't pass, it can only mean that it is injustifiable.

30:51.870 --> 30:53.720
And the martial world is dangerous.

30:53.720 --> 30:54.260
Wufeng

30:54.740 --> 30:56.800
is eager to get rid of the Gong Family.

30:57.660 --> 30:59.190
How can a weak Sword Wielder

30:59.980 --> 31:02.310
protect the bloodline of the Gong Family?

31:06.820 --> 31:08.090
It's only natural

31:08.820 --> 31:11.020
for you to pass the Trial of the Three Realms.

31:11.020 --> 31:12.350
How did it become

31:12.730 --> 31:14.790
I'm making things difficult for you?

31:14.870 --> 31:17.780
One month is putting him on a tight spot.

31:18.450 --> 31:19.210
Shangjue,

31:20.350 --> 31:22.670
I remember you took three months

31:23.610 --> 31:26.500
to prepare for the Trial of the Three Realms.

31:27.780 --> 31:28.840
Three months then.

31:29.700 --> 31:32.160
Lest Elder Yue thinks I have bad intentions.

31:33.460 --> 31:33.980
Ziyu...

31:34.700 --> 31:35.850
Three months then.

31:36.400 --> 31:38.290
There's no precedent of a Sword Wielder

31:38.290 --> 31:40.950
participating in the Trial of the Three Realms.

31:41.070 --> 31:43.750
What if an accident occurs during the trial?

31:43.780 --> 31:45.040
What are you afraid of?

31:46.160 --> 31:48.160
We will just follow the ancestral rule

31:48.160 --> 31:50.290
for the heir next-in-line to inherit.

31:50.880 --> 31:53.140
There are many people in the Gong Family.

31:56.890 --> 31:57.820
Wishing you all the best.

31:57.820 --> 31:58.820
You don't need to.

32:00.980 --> 32:02.340
I won't let you down.

32:03.410 --> 32:04.540
I will pass the test.

32:05.540 --> 32:06.250
You should

32:07.240 --> 32:10.040
wait until you get to the back mountain to say that.

32:34.070 --> 32:34.700
Hey!

32:35.200 --> 32:36.330
Where are you going?

32:38.250 --> 32:39.460
Just wandering around.

32:39.460 --> 32:39.990
Oh...

32:40.880 --> 32:41.900
Liar.

32:42.570 --> 32:44.770
You are going to pick up Miss Yun, right?

32:45.900 --> 32:47.760
Why do you ask if you already know?

32:48.020 --> 32:49.240
You're so thirsty.

32:50.600 --> 32:51.930
I'm still mourning now,

32:52.660 --> 32:54.500
I can't talk about marriage easily.

32:54.500 --> 32:55.460
But I can't just...

32:55.460 --> 32:57.520
leave Miss Yun in the Ladies' Hostel.

32:58.030 --> 33:00.090
Her identity has also been verified.

33:00.130 --> 33:03.330
I plan to take her back to the Yu Lineage for a peace of mind.

33:03.450 --> 33:04.820
An unmarried man and woman

33:04.820 --> 33:06.060
living together before marriage...

33:06.060 --> 33:07.300
The world is getting worse.

33:07.300 --> 33:08.630
I can't agree with that.

33:09.620 --> 33:10.490
What dirty things

33:10.490 --> 33:11.820
do you have on your mind?

33:12.750 --> 33:14.350
Don’t say that about Jin Fan.

33:14.700 --> 33:15.430
-What?
-Huh?

33:15.620 --> 33:18.090
All I have in my mind is Jin Fan.

33:20.660 --> 33:22.660
You only worry about Jin Fan all day.

33:22.660 --> 33:24.340
You're not worried about your brother who has to go through the trials.

33:24.340 --> 33:25.090
whether he is in danger,

33:25.090 --> 33:25.950
or will he fail?

33:27.340 --> 33:29.540
Your conscience has been eaten by a dog.

33:29.700 --> 33:31.900
Why are you talking about Jin Fan again?

33:34.620 --> 33:35.180
What?

33:35.800 --> 33:36.920
Infinite Heat?

33:37.440 --> 33:37.880
Yes.

33:39.260 --> 33:40.120
Infinite Heat.

33:41.370 --> 33:43.300
The Wufeng assassin that sneaked in among the brides

33:43.300 --> 33:44.500
has been identified.

33:45.210 --> 33:45.870
She is...

33:46.090 --> 33:48.300
the second daughter of the Hunyuan Zheng family,

33:48.300 --> 33:49.040
Zheng Nanyi.

33:54.340 --> 33:56.800
When I interrogated her personally just now,

33:56.800 --> 33:58.200
I found something amiss.

33:58.680 --> 34:00.010
Just tell me the result.

34:04.360 --> 34:06.080
I found a secret letter

34:06.110 --> 34:07.310
on Miss Zheng.

34:08.100 --> 34:09.300
The letter mentioned

34:11.730 --> 34:12.739
Infinite Heat.

34:17.340 --> 34:18.070
Are you sure?

34:34.340 --> 34:37.139
Infinite Heat is the top secret of the Gong Family.

34:38.120 --> 34:39.380
How could it be leaked?

34:40.210 --> 34:41.360
Infinite Heat...

34:42.050 --> 34:44.050
If it falls into the hands of Wufeng,

34:44.730 --> 34:47.190
there will never be peace to the Gong Family.

34:48.590 --> 34:49.590
In the front hill,

34:50.659 --> 34:52.320
other than the Sword Wielder,

34:53.170 --> 34:54.370
and the three Elders,

34:55.130 --> 34:57.730
the only people who knows about Infinite Heat,

34:57.730 --> 34:58.890
is you and me.

35:01.620 --> 35:02.790
You suspect me?

35:04.050 --> 35:05.740
I suspect

35:07.210 --> 35:08.450
anyone possible.

35:10.990 --> 35:12.590
You're not less suspicious than I am.

35:12.590 --> 35:13.050
Enough!

35:14.260 --> 35:15.460
We should not doubt

35:15.980 --> 35:17.730
among the Gong Family bloodline.

35:17.730 --> 35:18.830
Have you forgotten

35:18.850 --> 35:20.380
our ancestors' teachings?

35:21.420 --> 35:23.480
We must investigate it immediately.

35:23.580 --> 35:24.030
But!

35:24.740 --> 35:27.000
Don't let anyone know for the time being.

35:29.600 --> 35:33.300
The Zheng Family's trump card is in the hands of Young Master Shangjue.

35:33.300 --> 35:36.160
If Young Master Shangjue investigates it himself,

35:36.260 --> 35:38.390
he should be able to find out the truth.

35:38.690 --> 35:39.290
Shangjue.

35:39.860 --> 35:40.990
Outside the valley,

35:41.580 --> 35:42.660
you're the one most looked up to.

35:42.660 --> 35:44.460
You have the most means and methods too.

35:44.460 --> 35:45.460
I will count on you

35:45.490 --> 35:47.350
to make a trip to the Zheng Family.

35:47.500 --> 35:48.450
Understood.

35:50.330 --> 35:50.820
Huanyu,

35:51.260 --> 35:53.260
bring the female assassin here now.

35:53.640 --> 35:55.500
I want to interrogate her myself.

35:57.370 --> 35:57.880
Yes,

35:58.060 --> 35:58.590
Father.

36:05.300 --> 36:06.370
I can't believe it.

36:07.780 --> 36:09.510
I still don't understand

36:10.420 --> 36:13.520
how a bride who just entered Jiuchen Valley

36:14.810 --> 36:16.810
would know about the Infinite Heat?

36:18.210 --> 36:19.740
Fortunately,

36:19.790 --> 36:23.180
the secret letter did not mention too much about Infinite Heat.

36:23.180 --> 36:25.820
I think Wufeng didn't get much information.

36:26.180 --> 36:27.880
It's not a big crisis.

36:28.180 --> 36:28.550
No.

36:30.090 --> 36:31.820
I'm sure you elders are aware of

36:32.280 --> 36:34.180
the power of Infinite Heat.

36:35.220 --> 36:36.490
Just by letting the people of Wufeng know

36:36.490 --> 36:38.090
the existence of if,

36:38.860 --> 36:39.940
is already the biggest crisis Gong Family has had

36:39.940 --> 36:41.400
in over hundreds of years.

36:46.520 --> 36:47.120
By the way,

36:48.820 --> 36:51.820
since we've identified Housekeeper Jia's identity,

36:52.300 --> 36:53.810
can I release Yuanzhi

36:54.190 --> 36:55.320
from the prison?

36:57.110 --> 36:57.710
Of course.

36:58.260 --> 36:58.860
Of course.

37:11.660 --> 37:12.190
Brother.

37:33.630 --> 37:34.160
Let's go.

37:38.200 --> 37:39.800
The Trial of the Three Realms

37:40.620 --> 37:43.280
is essentially the battle of the Young Masters.

37:43.380 --> 37:45.390
It has been difficult in the past years,

37:45.390 --> 37:46.910
and many had suffered casualties and injuries.

37:46.910 --> 37:49.040
Those who can pass three trials at once

37:49.520 --> 37:50.920
are the cream of the crop.

37:53.060 --> 37:55.260
The last people who passed the Trial of the Three Realms

37:55.260 --> 37:58.060
were your brothers Gong Huanyu and Gong Shangjue.

38:00.860 --> 38:01.950
Father told me

38:02.410 --> 38:04.170
Gong Shangjue was the first person

38:04.170 --> 38:05.570
to pass the three trials.

38:05.980 --> 38:06.410
Huh?

38:06.700 --> 38:07.690
Then why was Huanyu

38:07.690 --> 38:09.030
the one who became the Young Lord?

38:09.030 --> 38:10.780
This is the first time I've heard of it.

38:10.780 --> 38:12.140
Because the Sword Wielder and the elders

38:12.140 --> 38:15.620
all thought he was more suitable to inherit the position of the Sword Wielder.

38:15.620 --> 38:16.360
What?

38:17.050 --> 38:18.980
Could Gong Shangjue agree to that?

38:19.180 --> 38:20.210
Of course not.

38:20.660 --> 38:22.880
He had dissatisfied written all over his face.

38:22.880 --> 38:24.190
Can't you see?

38:25.220 --> 38:26.550
Your eyesight is so bad.

38:28.340 --> 38:28.880
Jin Fan,

38:29.500 --> 38:31.230
don't say that about yourself.

38:31.740 --> 38:32.600
No matter what,

38:33.020 --> 38:34.980
I have to pass the Trial of the Three Realms as soon as possible

38:34.980 --> 38:37.020
so that no one will doubt me anymore.

38:38.570 --> 38:39.730
I support you.

38:40.490 --> 38:41.050
But,

38:41.380 --> 38:42.460
when did you

38:42.500 --> 38:45.560
become so enthusiastic about being the Sword Wielder?

38:45.570 --> 38:47.630
Do you remember when we were young...

38:47.860 --> 38:49.810
we skipped practice together...

38:50.040 --> 38:50.970
You've changed!

38:51.240 --> 38:52.770
It's not that I've changed.

38:54.390 --> 38:56.650
The more Gong Shangjue doesn't want me to be the Sword Wielder,

38:56.650 --> 38:58.780
the more I want to be the Sword Wielder.

38:59.530 --> 39:00.160
Besides,

39:01.250 --> 39:02.410
I must find out

39:02.890 --> 39:05.690
the truth behind my father and brother's death...

39:05.690 --> 39:06.690
and avenge them.

39:08.340 --> 39:08.720
Hey.

39:09.380 --> 39:09.760
Hey.

39:10.380 --> 39:11.680
We've already found out the truth.

39:11.680 --> 39:12.450
Wufeng did it.

39:12.450 --> 39:13.340
You didn't tell him?

39:13.340 --> 39:14.370
Think about it.

39:14.820 --> 39:16.330
He has been been hiding for so many years.

39:16.330 --> 39:18.590
Why did we find the Wufeng token only now?

39:19.510 --> 39:20.470
And why was it

39:20.910 --> 39:22.440
Gong Shangjue who found it?

39:23.720 --> 39:24.280
Besides,

39:24.920 --> 39:26.420
why would someone from Wufeng

39:26.420 --> 39:27.130
bring something

39:27.130 --> 39:28.790
as dangerous along with them?

39:31.980 --> 39:33.480
My back is so cold.

39:33.710 --> 39:35.310
-Hold me tight.
-Okay, okay.

39:36.730 --> 39:37.610
But now,

39:37.950 --> 39:39.410
there are no more clues.

39:40.960 --> 39:43.360
I have to pass the Trial of the Three Realms.

39:44.030 --> 39:44.490
Sister.

39:44.670 --> 39:45.050
Yes?

39:45.190 --> 39:46.920
Do you know what the first trial

39:46.990 --> 39:48.900
of the Trial of the Three Realms is?

39:48.900 --> 39:51.180
How would I, a weak lady,

39:51.210 --> 39:52.210
know?

39:52.610 --> 39:55.200
I don't even have the right to participate in the trial.

39:55.200 --> 39:56.180
You have no idea at all?

39:56.180 --> 39:57.940
Hahaha.

39:58.290 --> 39:59.110
No idea at all.

40:01.500 --> 40:02.210
I know.

40:12.760 --> 40:14.310
[Jue]

40:28.400 --> 40:28.930
Brother.

40:29.090 --> 40:30.420
Add in some Shi Hu for me.

40:31.300 --> 40:31.800
Okay.

40:38.970 --> 40:40.300
Is that Housekeeper Jia

40:41.210 --> 40:42.810
really someone from Wufeng?

40:43.730 --> 40:45.990
You've worked with him for so many years.

40:46.760 --> 40:48.290
Shouldn't you know better?

40:49.680 --> 40:50.740
Of course I do.

40:52.170 --> 40:53.570
That's why it's strange.

40:56.250 --> 40:57.640
But that Wufeng token

40:57.660 --> 40:59.430
was indeed found in his room.

41:04.080 --> 41:04.850
Could it be...

41:04.850 --> 41:06.270
you made a fake Wufeng token

41:06.270 --> 41:07.660
in order to save me?

41:09.820 --> 41:10.920
Nonsense.

41:12.770 --> 41:14.120
The token is real.

41:15.790 --> 41:16.700
But I think

41:17.940 --> 41:20.940
someone left it in Housekeeper Jia's room on purpose.

41:21.670 --> 41:22.730
Who is this person?

41:25.100 --> 41:26.030
I can't find him.

41:28.290 --> 41:29.560
Why did they help me?

41:31.780 --> 41:32.640
Help you?

41:34.930 --> 41:36.860
I think they're trying to harm you.

41:44.800 --> 41:46.960
We let Gong Ziyu have the first step this time.

41:46.960 --> 41:47.960
It's so annoying.

41:49.620 --> 41:50.660
And when I think about how

41:50.660 --> 41:53.030
I have to greet him as the Sword Wielder in the future

41:53.030 --> 41:54.430
makes me feel nauseated.

41:55.160 --> 41:56.850
A man should learn how to yield.

41:56.850 --> 41:57.950
Don't rush it.

41:58.990 --> 42:01.680
He won't be able to pass the Trial of the Three Realms.

42:01.680 --> 42:02.610
Unfortunately,

42:03.980 --> 42:05.330
I wanted to force him to hand over the position

42:05.330 --> 42:07.060
of the Sword Wielder in a month.

42:07.540 --> 42:09.200
But Elder Yue pleaded for him.

42:10.600 --> 42:11.730
I couldn't say more.

42:13.140 --> 42:13.940
Elder Yue

42:14.450 --> 42:15.780
always helps Gong Ziyu.

42:16.360 --> 42:17.350
It's really irritating.

42:17.350 --> 42:18.950
Don't talk about the elders.

42:21.450 --> 42:22.780
Among the three elders,

42:22.920 --> 42:24.320
Elder Yue is the kindest.

42:24.580 --> 42:25.710
He's easy to talk to.

42:26.320 --> 42:29.320
He pitied Gong Ziyu for losing his father and brother,

42:29.410 --> 42:32.000
and was assigned to be the Sword Wielder when he was in danger.

42:32.000 --> 42:34.260
Of course he'd support him a little more.

42:36.300 --> 42:37.360
Be it a month,

42:38.170 --> 42:39.340
or three months...

42:40.270 --> 42:41.330
It doesn't matter.

42:42.090 --> 42:43.220
As long as the result

42:43.490 --> 42:45.230
is as we expected.

42:45.300 --> 42:45.940
Of course.

42:47.630 --> 42:48.550
Back then,

42:49.100 --> 42:52.160
it took you so much to pass the Trial of the Three Realms.

42:52.910 --> 42:55.840
I don't think Gong Ziyu can even pass the first trial.

42:56.760 --> 42:58.160
Just wait to laugh at him.

43:05.370 --> 43:06.260
Yuanzhi,

43:07.400 --> 43:10.250
there's something that's inconvenient for me to do personally.

43:10.250 --> 43:11.340
But I don't trust to

43:12.080 --> 43:13.140
leave it to others.

43:14.690 --> 43:15.220
Brother,

43:15.700 --> 43:16.480
just tell me.

43:19.090 --> 43:19.870
I want you

43:20.530 --> 43:21.860
to bring Shangguan Qian

43:22.000 --> 43:23.890
from the Ladies' Hostel,

43:24.450 --> 43:27.450
and have her stay in the Jue Lineage for the time being.

43:31.940 --> 43:32.600
So soon?

43:34.020 --> 43:36.450
It's a marriage that's already been arranged.

43:36.450 --> 43:37.580
No matter it's fast,

43:38.250 --> 43:38.950
or slow,

43:40.360 --> 43:41.760
is there any difference?

43:43.110 --> 43:43.580
No.

43:44.900 --> 43:45.340
Mm.

43:47.220 --> 43:47.750
Brother.

43:48.050 --> 43:49.730
I understand that it's inconvenient for you

43:49.730 --> 43:50.710
to pick her up.

43:51.970 --> 43:53.700
But I don't understand why

43:54.350 --> 43:56.130
you can't trust others with this.

43:56.130 --> 43:57.590
What's there to not trust?

43:58.230 --> 43:59.890
Everyone knows you chose her.

44:00.760 --> 44:02.090
In this Gong Residence,

44:02.650 --> 44:05.510
could there be someone who would put her on the spot?

44:05.550 --> 44:07.080
What danger could she be in?

44:07.690 --> 44:08.520
I'm afraid

44:09.270 --> 44:10.670
others will be in danger.

44:15.790 --> 44:17.200
The prettier a woman is,

44:18.050 --> 44:19.510
the more dangerous she is.

44:24.320 --> 44:25.120
Is she pretty?

44:28.460 --> 44:29.860
Let me ask you a question.

44:31.670 --> 44:33.520
Who is prettier between

44:34.370 --> 44:36.170
Yun Weishan and Shangguan Qian?

44:39.730 --> 44:40.660
They're both...

44:41.330 --> 44:41.970
pretty.

44:43.770 --> 44:45.630
They are pretty in their own ways.

44:46.660 --> 44:47.460
That's right.

44:48.770 --> 44:49.600
So,

44:51.070 --> 44:53.600
they all have their dangers in their own ways.

44:57.570 --> 44:58.100
Brother,

44:59.090 --> 45:00.350
besides being pretty,

45:00.900 --> 45:03.300
what else do you like about Shangguan Qian?

45:30.490 --> 45:31.750
Young Master Yuanzhi.

45:33.610 --> 45:35.140
Thank you for picking me up.

45:38.090 --> 45:39.290
Young Master Yuanzhi...

45:39.290 --> 45:40.880
Doesn't talk much, do you?

45:43.080 --> 45:45.540
No wonder the servants in the other lineages

45:45.550 --> 45:46.790
were scared

45:47.160 --> 45:48.220
when they see you.

45:50.850 --> 45:52.180
It's better to be feared

45:52.270 --> 45:53.800
than to be afraid of others.

45:55.130 --> 45:56.060
That seems true.

45:59.520 --> 46:00.710
Young Master Yuanzhi!

46:00.710 --> 46:01.570
I want to ask...

46:01.890 --> 46:02.280
Ah!

46:11.650 --> 46:12.910
What do you want to ask?

46:14.140 --> 46:15.030
I want to ask...

46:15.690 --> 46:17.690
how far is the Jue Lineage from here?

46:18.450 --> 46:20.310
I'm afraid Young Master Shangjue

46:20.430 --> 46:22.360
will wait too long, and be anxious.

46:22.970 --> 46:23.970
He's not anxious.

46:25.030 --> 46:27.360
I think you are the one who's more anxious.

46:40.070 --> 46:41.270
Miss Shangguan Qian,

46:41.630 --> 46:43.890
where are you going with Young Master Yuanzhi?

46:43.890 --> 46:45.390
I’m here to take Miss Shangguan

46:45.390 --> 46:46.850
to stay at the Jue Lineage.

46:47.030 --> 46:47.640
Gong Ziyu.

46:48.310 --> 46:49.490
Where are you going?

46:50.070 --> 46:51.330
Young Master Yuanzhi,

46:52.240 --> 46:53.280
according to the etiquette,

46:53.280 --> 46:55.410
you should call him the Sword Wielder.

46:55.430 --> 46:55.960
Oh?

46:57.310 --> 46:58.850
He passed the Trial of the Three Realms

46:58.850 --> 46:59.980
in such a short time?

47:01.900 --> 47:02.360
Not yet.

47:02.750 --> 47:03.610
I'm sorry then.

47:03.800 --> 47:04.660
I can't call you

47:05.070 --> 47:06.130
the Sword Wielder.

47:08.160 --> 47:08.640
Then...

47:08.990 --> 47:10.570
call me sister.

47:15.730 --> 47:16.260
Sister.

47:18.110 --> 47:19.240
What about brother?

47:21.110 --> 47:21.970
That's enough.

47:22.270 --> 47:22.900
Enough.

47:23.760 --> 47:25.820
Don’t make it difficult for Yuanzhi.

47:26.010 --> 47:26.940
He's right.

47:27.230 --> 47:28.890
I'm not the Sword Wielder yet.

47:29.200 --> 47:29.800
But

47:30.740 --> 47:31.710
I will be soon.

47:32.360 --> 47:34.200
That's why we are just taking a walk around

47:34.200 --> 47:35.160
to get used to it.

47:36.210 --> 47:38.220
This is the way to the Ladies' Hostel.

47:38.220 --> 47:39.620
You're being too obvious

47:39.680 --> 47:40.960
walking around here.

47:42.150 --> 47:44.190
You're going to go pick up Yun Weishan,

47:44.190 --> 47:44.730
right?

47:45.150 --> 47:46.480
I didn't plan to do that.

47:47.670 --> 47:49.400
After all, it's inappropriate

47:49.630 --> 47:51.780
for an unmarried man and woman to stay together

47:51.780 --> 47:53.180
before getting married.

47:53.960 --> 47:55.180
But now it seems

47:56.080 --> 47:57.270
Gong Shangjue

47:58.000 --> 48:00.360
doesn't really care about etiquette either.

48:00.360 --> 48:02.020
So I'm just learning from him.

48:02.070 --> 48:03.220
There's nothing inappropriate about me

48:03.220 --> 48:04.550
picking Yun Weishan up.

48:10.230 --> 48:11.430
There are many things

48:11.580 --> 48:12.910
you still have to learn.

48:32.510 --> 48:33.210
Gosh.

48:35.660 --> 48:36.340
What now?

48:36.940 --> 48:38.670
I forgot something important.

48:38.740 --> 48:40.200
I need to go back and get it.

48:40.490 --> 48:41.830
There's everything in the Jue Lineage.

48:41.830 --> 48:42.630
Don't bother.

48:42.790 --> 48:43.390
Let's go.

48:43.500 --> 48:44.500
Jue Lineage...

48:45.190 --> 48:46.190
won't have it.

48:50.550 --> 48:51.390
What is it?

48:51.830 --> 48:52.730
It's so rare?

48:53.690 --> 48:56.020
A gift I prepared for Young Master Shangjue.

48:56.020 --> 48:57.480
My brother needs nothing.

48:57.870 --> 48:59.270
There are too many people

48:59.310 --> 49:00.440
who gives him gifts.

49:02.000 --> 49:03.060
That's different.

49:03.720 --> 49:05.200
Love between two...

49:07.720 --> 49:09.020
You are still young.

49:09.800 --> 49:11.600
Of course you don't understand.

49:16.030 --> 49:16.630
Forget it.

49:17.390 --> 49:18.650
I'll wait for you here.

49:18.750 --> 49:20.150
Go and come back quickly.

49:29.670 --> 49:31.870
Gong Shangjue is always ahead of us.

49:31.890 --> 49:32.880
It's as if he's calculated it.

49:32.880 --> 49:35.190
He's even a step ahead of us to pick up his bride.

49:35.190 --> 49:36.230
How annoying.

49:39.820 --> 49:40.750
Miss Shangguan.

49:44.490 --> 49:45.350
Sword Wielder.

49:46.450 --> 49:47.510
Why did you return?

49:48.390 --> 49:49.760
I forgot something.

49:51.000 --> 49:52.510
I'm really sorry.

49:53.720 --> 49:54.830
Sword Wielder.

49:54.830 --> 49:56.900
You are here to pick up Miss Yun, right?

49:56.900 --> 49:58.030
I'll get her for you.

49:58.300 --> 49:58.790
No need.

50:00.020 --> 50:01.260
It's such a trivial matter,

50:01.260 --> 50:02.440
I won’t bother you.

50:05.670 --> 50:07.270
Call Miss Yun Weishan for me.

50:09.750 --> 50:10.320
Yes.

50:16.310 --> 50:17.710
Thank you, Sword Wielder.

50:17.710 --> 50:18.900
I was thoughtless.

50:49.930 --> 50:52.460
The secret weapons at the Gong Family are laced with deadly poisonous.

50:52.460 --> 50:53.920
So they carry these

50:54.030 --> 50:55.460
special-made gloves

50:55.660 --> 50:56.780
soaked in special dye

50:56.780 --> 50:59.620
so they won't come into direct contact with the secret weapon.

50:59.620 --> 51:01.950
You can get poisoned even without a wound.

51:02.340 --> 51:04.470
Gong Family's poison is highly toxic.

51:04.570 --> 51:05.960
It can enter through

51:06.000 --> 51:07.340
the sweat glands and pores

51:07.340 --> 51:08.800
on the surface of your skin.

51:08.800 --> 51:09.420
And wax

51:09.900 --> 51:12.250
is the simplest and easiest to get.

51:12.630 --> 51:14.020
It can temporarily isolate

51:14.020 --> 51:15.380
the skin pores.

51:38.270 --> 51:39.050
Jin Fan.

51:39.580 --> 51:40.520
Look at them.

51:40.840 --> 51:42.440
How happy they are swimming.

51:43.440 --> 51:45.100
The fishes are just swimming.

51:45.370 --> 51:47.030
How do you know they are happy?

51:47.300 --> 51:48.070
What do you mean?

51:48.070 --> 51:49.070
Why are you acting

51:49.180 --> 51:50.390
all weird today?

51:52.470 --> 51:53.080
Miss Yun.

51:57.660 --> 51:59.120
You've already packed up?

51:59.720 --> 52:01.450
Don't worry. I can wait for you.

52:01.600 --> 52:02.930
Don't forget anything.

52:03.540 --> 52:05.140
I didn't have anything much.

52:07.280 --> 52:08.540
You do lack some stuff.

52:09.120 --> 52:10.430
I'll ask the servants tomorrow

52:10.430 --> 52:12.230
to prepare some clothes for you.

52:12.300 --> 52:13.190
There should be

52:13.300 --> 52:15.160
some jewellery in the Yu Lineage.

52:15.340 --> 52:16.540
If you like anything,

52:16.540 --> 52:17.540
you can pick some.

52:18.800 --> 52:19.910
If you need anything,

52:19.910 --> 52:20.840
just let me know.

52:25.140 --> 52:25.890
Miss Yun.

52:26.020 --> 52:27.390
Don't be shy.

52:27.620 --> 52:29.790
From now on, the Yu Lineage will be your family.

52:29.790 --> 52:32.720
You're going to be the wife of the Sword Wielder soon.

52:33.370 --> 52:35.100
If you need anything, just ask.

52:35.260 --> 52:36.320
Except for Jin Fan.

52:36.640 --> 52:37.850
Don't look for him.

52:38.390 --> 52:40.080
He lacks focus.

52:40.430 --> 52:42.380
He can't resist temptation

52:42.740 --> 52:44.800
when he sees beauties like both of us.

52:44.980 --> 52:46.510
What are you talking about?

52:50.540 --> 52:51.160
Miss Yun.

52:52.360 --> 52:53.620
We're not married yet.

52:53.850 --> 52:55.050
I'm afraid you have to

52:55.690 --> 52:58.030
live in the Yu Lineage first as an attendant.

52:58.030 --> 52:59.150
That is all right.

52:59.910 --> 53:01.110
You came to pick me up.

53:01.640 --> 53:02.890
I should be happy.

53:04.900 --> 53:06.150
I still like it more

53:06.660 --> 53:08.400
when you call me Young Master Huanyu.

53:08.400 --> 53:09.800
Calling me Sword Wielder

53:10.170 --> 53:11.830
leaves a distance between us.

53:13.370 --> 53:14.000
Miss Yun.

53:14.390 --> 53:16.220
If anyone bullies you in the Gong Residence,

53:16.220 --> 53:17.400
just tell Gong Ziyu.

53:17.590 --> 53:19.230
If Gong Ziyu bullies you,

53:19.230 --> 53:20.170
just tell me.

53:20.580 --> 53:21.280
Although

53:21.390 --> 53:22.580
I can't deal with him,

53:22.580 --> 53:23.640
but I can annoy him.

53:25.070 --> 53:26.540
What are you talking about?

53:26.540 --> 53:27.610
Just kidding.

53:27.670 --> 53:29.530
Can't you see Miss Yun is nervous?

53:30.420 --> 53:32.030
But I'm afraid he will have to put his mind to

53:32.030 --> 53:34.020
the Trial of the Three Realms in the future.

53:34.020 --> 53:35.950
He won't have the time to bully you.

53:37.210 --> 53:38.870
The Trial of the Three Realms?

53:39.030 --> 53:39.930
What is that?

53:40.050 --> 53:40.440
Oh?

53:44.840 --> 53:45.450
Miss Yun.

53:46.050 --> 53:48.380
Come along with me if you're done packing.

53:48.730 --> 53:49.730
Thank you, Sword–

53:51.250 --> 53:51.830
Hmm...

53:53.570 --> 53:55.230
Thank you, Young Master Ziyu.

53:57.910 --> 53:58.460
But...

53:59.500 --> 54:00.100
Young Master Ziyu,

54:00.100 --> 54:00.740
you didn't have to

54:00.740 --> 54:02.800
to pick me up from the Ladies' Hostel.

54:03.120 --> 54:05.320
You could've sent someone to inform me.

54:06.730 --> 54:08.660
I'm afraid others will gossip

54:08.980 --> 54:10.240
and cause you trouble.

54:12.740 --> 54:14.200
If anyone dares to gossip,

54:14.570 --> 54:16.100
I will teach them the rules.

54:16.660 --> 54:17.240
Besides,

54:18.630 --> 54:20.290
I'm here to pick up my fiancee.

54:20.540 --> 54:21.340
What’s wrong?

54:26.460 --> 54:27.390
Miss Shangguan.

54:31.900 --> 54:33.140
You took what you left behind?

54:33.140 --> 54:33.610
Yes.

54:35.750 --> 54:38.550
Miss Yun Weishan, it's best you go have a check too.

54:38.750 --> 54:40.120
Don't be like me.

54:40.150 --> 54:41.100
I realized I forgot something only halfway there

54:41.100 --> 54:42.270
and had to come back for it.

54:42.270 --> 54:43.400
It's a waste of time.

54:43.740 --> 54:45.990
It's getting dark.

54:47.740 --> 54:48.630
Sword Wielder,

54:48.840 --> 54:49.900
I'll take my leave.

54:49.980 --> 54:52.180
Young Master Yuanzhi is waiting for me.

55:18.700 --> 55:19.300
Miss Yun?

55:22.070 --> 55:23.040
In that case,

55:23.240 --> 55:24.670
I'll go check again.
